&lt;p&gt;I've been putting together an ACLS lecture script lately: 120 slides, nearly 30,000 characters, all of it in Keynote's speaker notes. When I teach, I keep my laptop on the lectern and turn my head to glance at what comes next after every section.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>